Right fix in another shape, for two defects: a user without manage_gyms
may not reset a superuser or an account that holds manage_gyms, read
from the permission tables, so a deactivated account counts too. It
closes the gym manager's path up to the admin, a general manager, or a
superuser, active (s3) or deactivated (s6). Trainers and fellow managers
stay open (s4), and general managers still reset each other (s5).

Fixes: s3-reset-password-higher-role, s6-reset-password-deactivated-role

diff --git a/wger/gym/views/gym.py b/wger/gym/views/gym.py
